# CGGS Design System

## Palette

Use **Navy Blue, White, Gold** only. Define tokens in `globals.css`:

```css
--color-navy: #0a1628;
--color-gold: #c5a028;
--color-white: #ffffff;
```

Do NOT use sky-blue, neon, or dark-slate dev palettes.

## Aesthetic

Premium government summit — authority, trust, prestige, maritime identity.

References: World Governments Summit, WEF, COP, G20.

**Avoid:** sports UI, gaming style, glassmorphism, cartoon graphics, heavy gradients, colorful icon packs.

## Components

- Hero section on every major page (title, subtitle, breadcrumb, background image)
- Cards: image, title, description, action — for events, speakers, ships, news
- Buttons: Primary (navy), Secondary (white + navy border), Accent (gold)
- Forms: large labels, clear validation, large click targets
- Tables: zebra rows, sticky headers (schedule, transport, accommodation)
- Icons: outlined, simple, professional, consistent size

## Layout

- Grid: 12-col desktop, 8-col tablet, 4-col mobile
- Generous whitespace, minimal shadows, small border radius
- Sticky header with scroll appearance change

## Motion

Framer Motion: subtle fade, slide, scale only. No bounce, elastic, or long animations.

## Accessibility

WCAG AA — keyboard nav, high contrast, visible focus states, readable typography.

